      {
        "t": "mistake",
        "html": "Two different <b>ped</b>s. Latin <b>ped</b> means foot (<i>pedal</i>, <i>pedestrian</i>, <i>expedite</i>). Greek <b>ped</b> means child: a <i>pediatrician</i> is a children’s doctor, not a foot doctor. And <b>cursory</b> has nothing to do with cursing: a cursory look runs quickly over things."
